VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'just well, it kind of misses the aesthetic balance. We\'re looking for something here that feels super premium. When Apple do it, obviously they\'re just using the Apple logo, which is an image mark, not a word mark. So, I would love to see them work out their image mark,'

[02:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and just simplify it. Maybe place it on here or just on the middle of the monitor so it feels a little bit cleaner. That would be lovely. Now, on the finish of the actual aluminium, it\'s super clean. This isn\'t a single piece'

