AUDIO: 'dock for me. Anyway, one side note, the Miro isn\'t tied to Mac. I think a PC with a compatible USBC or display port output can use this, too, although the resolution and refresh rate will depend'

[05:23] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'on what that computer supports. And one clever touch, the firmware is upgradable. There is an ability to update firmware natively via the connection to your Mac in the monitor. We\'ll have to confirm that. But that\'s'

[05:35] [scene:talk]
