AUDIO: 'don\'t know if it is. Brightness is 500 nits in normal use. That\'s only 100 nits less than the standard studio display. And this is 32 in. And it\'s less money. And it\'s 750 nits with HDR enabled. And well, if you look closely when you\'re'

